Output preview.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 24
Set LineHeight 1.4
Set Width 1400
Set Height 520
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#1e1e2e"

Hide
Type "source demo/setup.zsh"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Show

Type "ls"
Enter
Sleep 700ms

Type "touch wip.tmp"
Enter
Sleep 700ms

Type "git status -s"
Enter
Sleep 700ms

Type "rm wip.tmp"
Enter
Sleep 1000ms
